.TH MARBOR\-NODES 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-nodes \- list nodes known to marbor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor nodes
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
list nodes known to marbor
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B confirm\-tls <node>
pin a marbor agent's TLS certificate fingerprint (headless enrollment)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-fingerprint string
SHA-256 fingerprint the operator has independently confirmed matches the node's actual TLS certificate (see "agent service status" on the node), in the form SHA256:<64 hex characters> (required)
.RE
.TP
.B patch <node>
set deployment parallelism or per\-model VRAM overrides for a node (P397, P411)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-parallelism-type string
parallelism type: tp, pp, ep, dp (empty to clear)
.TP
.B \-\-parallelism-width int
parallelism width 1..64 (0 to clear)
.TP
.B \-\-vram-override string
per\-model VRAM size overrides in MB, comma\-separated model=mb pairs - REPLACES the whole declared list, dropping any entry not listed here (empty to clear all)
.RE
.TP
.B add <name> <url>
add (or update, by name) a node in the fleet (P\-A2-01)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-runtime string
runtime: ollama (default), vllm, tgi, llamacpp, mlx
.TP
.B \-\-gpu-model string
GPU model label (informational)
.TP
.B \-\-vram-total-mb int
declared total VRAM in MB (0 = unknown)
.RE
.TP
.B remove <node>
remove a node from the fleet (P\-A2-01)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-yes
confirm removal without prompting
.RE
.TP
.B warmup
get or set a node's proactive warmup config (P\-A2-02)
.TP
.B warmup get <node>
show a node's proactive warmup config
.TP
.B warmup set <node>
set a node's proactive warmup config
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-enabled
enable proactive warmup for the listed models
.TP
.B \-\-models string
comma\-separated models to keep resident (empty clears)
.RE
.TP
.B pinned
get or set a node's never\-evict (pinned) model list (P\-A2-02)
.TP
.B pinned get <node>
show a node's pinned model list
.TP
.B pinned set <node>
set a node's pinned model list (whole\-list replace)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-models string
comma\-separated models to pin (empty clears all)
.RE
.TP
.B prewarm
disable or re\-enable predictive prewarm for a node (P\-A2-02)
.TP
.B prewarm set <node>
disable or re\-enable predictive prewarm for a node
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-disabled
disable predictive prewarm for this node
.RE
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
